From: PortareOS <hello@portare.org>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qdsp6: allow 44100 on the LPASS RX DAIs

Both playback backends on SM8550 advertise 8000, 16000, 32000, 48000 and
176400, so 44.1 kHz content cannot reach the hardware at its own rate and
is resampled to 48000 before it gets there. That covers most of what this
device plays: the Dreamcast's AICA is 44.1 kHz with no 48 kHz mode, and so
are the PS1 SPU and the PSP.

Nothing below the DAI objects to 44100. The speaker amps are two
awinic,aw88166 whose AW88166_RATES is SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000_48000, which
includes it, and which declare no dai_ops at all: the part reads its rate
off I2S rather than being configured. The headphone codec is wcd938x,
which carries an explicit WCD938X_FRAC_RATES_MASK listing 44100, 88200 and
176400. Above the DAI, q6apm_lpass_dai_prepare only copies the rate into
audioreach_module_config and hands it to the DSP, with no rate of its own.
The mask is the only thing in the way.

The bet is that LPASS can clock the 44.1 kHz family and upstream simply
never listed it, which the 176400 already in the mask makes plausible:
176400 is 4 x 44100, so a 44.1 kHz clock is evidently reachable.

If the bet is wrong the DSP rejects the graph configuration and playback
fails, or the clock is wrong and the pitch is audibly off. Both show up
immediately and neither is destructive.

Only the two RX macros are touched. The TX and TDM ones share the same
mask but capture is not what this is for.
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-ports.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-ports.c
@@ -47,8 +47,8 @@
 		.playback = {						\
 			.stream_name = #did" Playback",	\
 			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,			\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_44100 |\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,	\
 			.formats = SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S16_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S32_LE,		\
@@ -100,8 +100,8 @@
 		.playback = {						\
 			.stream_name = pre" MI2S Playback",	\
 			.rates = SNDRV_PCM_RATE_8000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_16000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 |\
-				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,			\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_32000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_44100 |\
+				SNDRV_PCM_RATE_48000 | SNDRV_PCM_RATE_176400,	\
 			.formats = SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S16_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S24_LE |		\
 				   SNDRV_PCM_FMTBIT_S32_LE,		\
